KubeOS control-plane binaries
=============================

/usr/local/bin contains these unmodified upstream release binaries, vendored at
build time by config/hooks/normal/9025-vendor-control-plane-binaries.hook.chroot:

  kube-apiserver            Kubernetes, https://dl.k8s.io/vX.Y.Z/bin/linux/amd64/
  kube-controller-manager   Kubernetes, same source
  kube-scheduler            Kubernetes, same source
  kube-proxy                Kubernetes, same source
  etcd                      etcd, https://github.com/etcd-io/etcd/releases/
  etcdctl                   etcd, same source

kubelet, kubectl and kubeadm are NOT vendored here: they are installed from the
pkgs.k8s.io apt repository and live in /usr/bin.

Both projects are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The licence texts
ship next to this file as LICENSE.kubernetes and LICENSE.etcd; they are identical
except for the copyright line in the appendix, which is why both are kept verbatim
instead of one being copied over the other.

The version of the Kubernetes binaries is read from the installed kubelet at build
time and the etcd version from the tag kubeadm pins, so the whole control plane is
one consistent release.

